---
// Rebuilt from the live WordPress page layout.
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Kids Party Events Program - clamcentral.com">
	<main class="px-4 pt-12 pb-20" style="background: #fffdf4">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1080px]">
			<div>
				<h1 style="font-size:clamp(34px, 3.57vw, 50px);line-height:1.30;color:rgb(12, 17, 21);text-align:center;font-weight:700">Kids Party Events Program</h1>
				<p style="font-size:clamp(22px, 2.29vw, 32px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center"><strong>Fun games and Bible stories midweek events.</strong></p>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:21px">
				<img src="/images/pages/kids-party1.webp" alt="" width="2080" height="597" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:1040px" />
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:21px">
				<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.57vw, 22px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center"><strong>Great games and always a Bible story,</strong> for kids in the Upper Elementary age-level. Designed to pour kids and their families into your church. The full program lasts three years before being repeated, so yeah, it's big.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-center" style="margin-top:46px">
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:199px">
					<img src="/images/pages/kp-leader.webp" alt="" width="400" height="539" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:199px" />
				</div>
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:775px">
					<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:775px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto"><strong>The KIDS PARTY Leader Guide.</strong> KIDS PARTY is a highly effective and proven means of drawing new kids and families into your fellowship. From the kids’ point of view, KIDS PARTY is a series of super-fun 90-minute events featuring action games, teams, points, and effective Bible story teaching. For you, the KIDS PARTY program provides all the games, instructions, forms, posters, artwork and music to run 36 KP events—plenty for three years!</p>
					<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:775px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">You’ll have the opportunity to meet and befriend new kids and their parents, a great way to extend warm invitations to your worship services and other church events.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:37px">
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>You can do just one KIDS PARTY if you like</strong>, but the secret to success is to run at least one a month for eight or nine months during the school year.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Two special season-ending events</strong>—the two-hour SUPER PARTY and the unique MYSTERY PARTY—keep kids coming all year long.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>KIDS PARTY is aimed at kids in the upper elementary grades.</strong> You can adjust activities to suit the abilities of kids from third to sixth grades. As you study the various resources, you’ll see that we understand how to work with kids that are gregarious and kids that are wallflowers—both at the same time!</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Extra Good News:</strong> A huge staff is not required to run KIDS PARTY. We list the needs in detail in a FAQ article.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-center" style="margin-top:43px">
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:199px">
					<img src="/images/pages/kp-games.webp" alt="" width="400" height="539" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:199px" />
				</div>
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:775px">
					<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:775px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto"><strong>KIDS PARTY Games and Stunts.</strong> Games we created ourselves, games we found, games well-known, games obscure. All great for KIDS PARTY! All thoroughly tested with KIDS PARTY kids and approved by us. Complete with tips to maximize the fun.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:31px">
				<h3 style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.40;color:rgb(12, 17, 21);text-align:left;font-weight:700">Inside: Nine Game Categories...</h3>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:2px">
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Games to Play as Kids Arrive.</strong> Quick and easy.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Points Giveaway Games</strong><strong>.</strong> Simple ways to pump points to the kids.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Games to Fill the Gaps</strong>. Quick activities to gain time for bigger things.</p>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:1px">
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Relays Races</strong>. Great for team-building and lasting friendships.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Water Games.</strong> Tell ’em to bring towels.</p>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:1px">
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Messy Messy.</strong> Messy, messy.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Wutchumacallems</strong>. Games that don’t fit the above categories.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Volunteer Stunts.</strong> Kids volunteer to do these crowd-pleasers.</p>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:1px">
				<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left"><strong>Watchables</strong>. Simple computer games that play themselves on your large screen as the kids watch. Use these to choose a team or give away points. Unbelievably engrossing!</p>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-center" style="margin-top:45px">
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:199px">
					<img src="/images/pages/kp-wall-games-1.webp" alt="" width="400" height="536" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:199px" />
				</div>
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:775px">
					<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:775px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto"><strong>KIDS PARTY Wall Games 1.</strong> A tabloid-size poster page of games to display on the wall. Kids just wanna earn KIDS PARTY Points--here are more options, more games for you to choose when planning your KIDS PARTY events.</p>
					<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:775px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto"><strong>Included in the pack is the fun MYSTERY PARTY Contract.</strong> Each year the KIDS PARTY kids look forward with great anticipation to the year-ending MYSTERY PARTY. The Party is a great surprise, and everyone loves surprises. That’s why we have the kids sign a contract to tell no one (except their parents) what happens there. That way, you can repeat your best MYSTERY PARTIES down the road, when the little brothers and sisters have started attending KIDS PARTY. Of course, the contract is tongue-in-cheek, but it does help build the suspense.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-center" style="margin-top:66px">
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:199px">
					<img src="/images/pages/kp-wall-games-2.webp" alt="" width="400" height="539" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:199px" />
				</div>
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:775px">
					<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:775px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto"><strong>KIDS PARTY Wall Games 2.</strong> As said above, your KIDS PARTY kids want to earn points! Points are everything at KIDS PARTY. The Leader Guide has full details.</p>
					<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:775px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">The pages in this resource form four games kids can play to earn quick points. Some of the games are meant to be used with larger pages from the Wall Games 1 resource.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-center" style="margin-top:61px">
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:466px">
					<img src="/images/pages/kp-image.webp" alt="" width="932" height="496" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:466px" />
				</div>
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:294px">
					<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:294px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto"><strong>There are even MORE resources:</strong><br />Promo Posters, artwork and... <br />• KP Mark Party Guides 1-12 <br />• KP Mark Biggie Verses<br />• KP Moses Party Guides 1-12<br />• KP Moses Biggie Verses<br />• KP Daniel Party Guides 1-12<br />• KP Daniel Biggie Verses</p>
					<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:294px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">• KP Watchables 1</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:61px">
				<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:503px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto"><strong>Yes, don't forget the incredible KP Watchables 1!</strong> Simple computer games that play themselves on your large screen as the kids watch. Use these to choose a team or give away points. Unbelievably engrossing!</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;max-width:503px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Eight great games: KP Ball, At the Races, Pizza Toss, KP Points Bingo, The Name Game, 10x, Doorski and Squeal or No Squeal. <a href="/kids-party-watchables/">LEARN MORE...</a></p>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:70px">
				<div class="text-center"><a href="/kidspartycomplete/njjryusagzcpohuskp/Kids-Party-Complete.zip" class="inline-block w-full rounded-[5px] px-[18px] py-3 font-button text-[18px] font-bold tracking-[2px] text-white hover:opacity-85" style="max-width:437px;background:rgb(19, 92, 164)">Download KIDS PARTY!</a></div>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:40px">
				<div class="text-center"><a href="https://www.clamcentral.com/my/donation/?checkout_id=853135ac-1fc1-420d-857e-d4db00e6beb8" class="inline-block w-full rounded-[5px] px-[18px] py-3 font-button text-[18px] font-bold tracking-[2px] text-white hover:opacity-85" style="max-width:437px;background:rgb(19, 164, 159)">Offer Your Support :)</a></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
